Status: provisional. The phonon.dll we ship comes from our Steam Audio fork release v4.8.1-pba.1,
built without Intel IPP: Steam Audio and the Embree it links are both Apache-2.0 (licence texts in
the release zip). Valve's official phonon.dll bundles Intel IPP under a proprietary binary licence;
we no longer ship it. The licence of this directory is still to be confirmed before any release.
